Dropbox :   (Sender , Receiver)
---------

The Dropbox adapter in SAP Cloud Platform Integration (CPI) is a connector that enables you to
exchange files between your Dropbox account and SAP systems. It allows you to create, retrieve,
update, and delete files within your Dropbox storage via the CPI.

what is Dropbox :
-> Dropbox is a popular cloud storage service that allows users to store, share, and access files
 from any device with an internet connection. It provides a centralized location for files,
 synchronizes them across devices, and offers features for collaboration and file sharing.


